<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela labor minister becomes attorney general.</title>
<headline>Venezuela labor minister becomes attorney general.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's Congress voted Thursday to install former labour minister Juan Nepomuceno Garrido as attorney general.</p>
<p>President Rafael Caldera proposed Garrido last week after Jesus Petit da Costa resigned as attorney general in protest over alleged lack of cooperation from top government officials.</p>
<p>Garrido's successor at the Labour Ministry has not been named.</p>
